  "title": "Avery Dennison unveils industry-first RFID label recognized by APR for compatibility with PET recycling stream",
  "summary": "Avery Dennison has announced a breakthrough in recyclable labeling: The first RFID label to receive APR Design® for Recyclability (DfR) recognition from the Association of Plastic Recyclers (APR). This marks an industry first for an RFID label, validating its compatibility with North America's PET recycling stream.",
